<h2>Helpers</h2>

<p>
  SmartCGMS is a set of libraries, which are by-default runtime-loaded, dynamic ones. For special purposes and with an appropriate commerical license, these can be static to satisfy all embedded-device needs. Due to the library-nature of the SmartCGMS, we provide several
  helpers to easy work with the {doclink('sdk','configuration','configuration')|noescape}, {doclink('sdk','execution','execution')|noescape} and {doclink('sdk','optimizer','optimization')|noescape}.
</p>